cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OHQ-Slope
message: >-
  If you use OHQ-Slope, cite the software and identify the exact Git commit
  used in your calculations. Cite OpenHydroQual separately for the engine.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shakouri
    given-names: Behzad
repository-code: https://github.com/behzadshakouri/OHQ-Slope
url: https://github.com/behzadshakouri/OHQ-Slope
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  A local research workspace for rainfall-driven slope stability and
  uncertainty quantification using OpenHydroQual hydrology, an infinite-slope
  factor-of-safety calculation, and independently checked JSON diagnostics.
keywords:
  - OpenHydroQual
  - slope stability
  - factor of safety
  - rainfall infiltration
  - uncertainty quantification
  - Monte Carlo
  - hydroinformatics
